{"unit_id":"tag:00WN:statement","translation":"上面定义的单射（injective）（相应地，<SPACE_0001>满射（surjective））映射（maps），恰好是单态射（monomorphisms）（相应地，<SPACE_0002>满态射（epimorphisms）），这里是在范畴（category）<MATH_0001> 中考虑。层（sheaves）的映射（map）是同构（isomorphism），当且仅当它既是单射的（injective），又是满射的（surjective）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"monomorphisms","target_term":"单态射"},{"source_term":"epimorphisms","target_term":"满态射"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射的"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射的"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射","context":"前定义中的单射映射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"前定义中的满射映射"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"层之间的映射"},{"source_term":"monomorphisms","target_term":"单态射","context":"层范畴中的单态射"},{"source_term":"epimorphisms","target_term":"满态射","context":"层范畴中的满态射"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"层范畴"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"同构判据中的层"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"同构判据中的层映射"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"既单又满的层映射"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射的","context":"同构判据的单射条件"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射的","context":"同构判据的满射条件"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:00WO:prose-0003","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n可表的（representable）层（sheaf）是一个同时为层（sheaf）的可表的（representable）预层（presheaf）。在拓扑（topology）不是子典范的（subcanonical）时，或许最好避免使用这一术语，所以我们只在那种情形正式定义它。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表的"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表的"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"subcanonical","target_term":"子典范的"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表的","context":"可表层及其所对应的可表预层"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"可表预层同时满足层条件"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层","context":"可表层所对应的预层"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"使用可表层术语的拓扑条件"},{"source_term":"subcanonical","target_term":"子典范的","context":"原文讨论何时宜使用可表层这一术语"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:00WR:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为位点（site），其拓扑（topology）是子典范的（subcanonical）。米田嵌入（Yoneda embedding）<MATH_0002>（见范畴（Categories）第 <REF_0001> 节）将 <MATH_0003> 表示为一个完全子范畴（full subcategory），嵌入 <MATH_0004> 上的层（sheaves）范畴（category）。在这种情况下，我们将形如 <MATH_0005> 且满足 <MATH_0006> 的层（sheaves），称为 <TEXTITOPEN_0001>可表层（representable sheaves）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，位于 <MATH_0007> 上。记号：有时，将可表的（representable）层（sheaf）<MATH_0008>（与 <MATH_0009> 相伴）记为 <TEXTITOPEN_0002><MATH_0010><TEXTITCLOSE_0002>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"subcanonical","target_term":"子典范的"},{"source_term":"Yoneda embedding","target_term":"米田嵌入"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"full subcategory","target_term":"完全子范畴"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"representable sheaves","target_term":"可表层"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表的"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"具有子典范拓扑的位点"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"位点的拓扑"},{"source_term":"subcanonical","target_term":"子典范的","context":"可表预层均为层"},{"source_term":"Yoneda embedding","target_term":"米田嵌入","context":"把底范畴嵌入层范畴的函子"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴","context":"引用范畴章"},{"source_term":"full subcategory","target_term":"完全子范畴","context":"底范畴在层范畴中的像"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"底位点上的层"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"层范畴"},{"source_term":"representable sheaves","target_term":"可表层","context":"强调区域中命名的层"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表的","context":"记号说明中的可表性"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"与给定对象相伴的可表层"}],"notes":[]}
